{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crystal of Atlan is a Magicpunk MMO Action RPG where you can immerse yourself in a Magicpunk world. Build your skills, fight and uncover the secrets of this world with your allies! Time to embark on a wondrous journey of Magic and Machinery!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MULTIPLE CLASSES TO CHOOSE FROM, COMBOS OF YOUR OWN</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 10 classes to choose from, all unlocked from the start, each with over 20 skill combinations, providing ample room for players to experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/36ccd0ac6dc53c30643609a55bab6886.poster.webp?t=1751045138\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/36ccd0ac6dc53c30643609a55bab6886.webp?t=1751045138\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SMOOTH COMBAT PERFECTED WITH DYNAMIC AIR COMBOS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take fights into the air and pull off stylish air combos! In addition to the X/Y axis focus of mainstream 3D games, Crystal of Atlan puts an emphasis on utilizing the Z-axis in combat, offering a refined aerial combat experience that innovates the traditional MMORPG combat style. Effortless style on your enemies with refined and fluid controls over skill casts and character movement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/c2ef360e887816aef9150fbb6fed94e9.poster.webp?t=1751045138\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/c2ef360e887816aef9150fbb6fed94e9.webp?t=1751045138\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHALLENGING TEAM BATTLES</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can experience various multiplayer elements, including co-op dungeons and a guild fleet system, allowing you to connect with like-minded friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/7e11a169feccfa1cf91a9921e2a8c0c0.poster.webp?t=1751045138\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/7e11a169feccfa1cf91a9921e2a8c0c0.webp?t=1751045138\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FAIR, SKILL-BASED PVP</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy competitive PvP with 3v3 and 1v1 modes, where everything from attributes to skill damage/cooldown is perfectly balanced. In this arena, skill is the only factor determining the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/d9666412280e837c35b3d4731775d4ac.poster.webp?t=1751045138\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/d9666412280e837c35b3d4731775d4ac.webp?t=1751045138\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DISTINCT DUNGEONS AND BOSSES</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along your journey, you will venture into various locations and dungeons, such as ancient Atlan Ruins, Black Street, and the Sewers. At the end of each dungeon is a unique boss with special mechanics that will put your skills to the test. Explore the dungeons, overcome all obstacles, and get stronger in the process!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A UNIQUE MAGICPUNK WORLD</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an epic journey through a fantastical world where magic and technology intertwine. As a free-spirited adventurer, uncover the secrets of ancient Atlan ruins and confront powerful factions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/4c9ba80febced9b35251eb45d2d8ef8d.poster.webp?t=1751045138\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/4c9ba80febced9b35251eb45d2d8ef8d.webp?t=1751045138\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839850?t=1751045138","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/fc5627d4a9091cfd9a00b8636d2a2110f095d784/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751045138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/6e23137f41ce6ccd712946503a543e75a3b745ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751045138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/6e23137f41ce6ccd712946503a543e75a3b745ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751045138","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crystal of Atlan is a Magicpunk MMO 