raph\"><strong>CHALLENGING TEAM BATTLES</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can experience various multiplayer elements, including co-op dungeons and a guild fleet system, allowing you to connect with like-minded friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/7e11a169feccfa1cf91a9921e2a8c0c0.poster.webp?t=1751045138\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/7e11a169feccfa1cf91a9921e2a8c0c0.webp?t=1751045138\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FAIR, SKILL-BASED PVP</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy competitive PvP with 3v3 and 1v1 modes, where everything from attributes to skill damage/cooldown is perfectly balanced. In this arena, skill is the only factor determining the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/d9666412280e837c35b3d4731775d4ac.poster.webp?t=1751045138\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/d9666412280e837c35b3d4731775d4ac.webp?t=1751045138\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DISTINCT DUNGEONS AND BOSSES</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along your journey, you will venture into various locations and dungeons, such as ancient Atlan Ruins, Black Street, and the Sewers. At the end of each dungeon is a unique boss with special mechanics that will put your skills to the test. Explore the dungeons, overcome all obstacles, and get stronger in the process!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A UNIQUE MAGICPUNK WORLD</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an epic journey through a fantastical world where magic and technology intertwine. As a free-spirited adventurer, uncover the secrets of ancient Atlan ruins and confront powerful factions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/4c9ba80febced9b35251eb45d2d8ef8d.poster.webp?t=1751045138\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/4c9ba80febced9b35251eb45d2d8ef8d.webp?t=1751045138\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>","developers":["Nuverse Pte.Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/688a8c4a3a409e402960e6e14a5107f8b2411855/header.jpg?t=1751045138","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright Skystone Games All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257160786,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160786/movie480.mp4?t=1751045135","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160786/movie_max.mp4?t=1751045135"},"name":"CoA","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257160786/51639f817db7f60e5632106e327b87ceeb8bfab9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751045135","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160786/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751045135","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160786/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751045135"}}],"name":"Crystal of Atlan","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Wi